				<div class="help-keypoint">
					<iconify icon="lucide:swords" Size=@(16) Color="#fb923c" />
					<span><strong>Physical</strong> — sword, claw, bite. Damage is calculated from the attacker's ATK against the target's DEF.</span>
				</div>
				<div class="help-keypoint">
					<iconify icon="lucide:sparkles" Size=@(16) Color="#a78bfa" />
					<span><strong>Special</strong> — magic, beams, breath. Uses the attacker's SpA against the target's SpD.</span>
				</div>
				<div class="help-keypoint">
					<iconify icon="lucide:wand-2" Size=@(16) Color="#7dd3fc" />
					<span><strong>Status</strong> — buffs, debuffs, conditions. Doesn't deal damage directly — instead it shifts stats, applies effects, or sets up the next turn.</span>
