			<HelpHero HeroIcon="lucide:zap" HeroTitle="Crits and PP" HeroSubtitle="The two systems most fights pivot on" />

			<p class="help-lead">
				Critical hits decide a surprising number of close battles. PP — power points
				per move — keeps you from spamming your strongest attacks forever.
			</p>

			<span class="help-section-title">Critical hits</span>
			<div class="help-callout">
				<span class="help-callout-eyebrow">Base 1 in 16 chance</span>
